The function _depositRawEthIntoLido does not check the return value of the external call to the stEth contract. This can lead to a situation where the call to the stEth contract fails silently, and the function continues execution without any indication of failure. This could result in a discrepancy in the accounting of stEth balances, potentially leading to financial loss.

